    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know people say they care, but i can see it in their eyes. it's like they're just being polite. i'm just tired of the cycle. everything feels so permanent, like this heaviness is never going to lift. sometimes it feels like the most honest thing i could do is just stop fighting it all. does that even make sense?",
